# This repo distributes the Slipspace Android app. Only the APK and the README
# belong here — the application source lives elsewhere and must never be pushed
# to this repo (it carries the message encryption key, the password pepper, the
# database, and uploaded files).

# Everything except the app and its docs
*

!.gitignore
!README.md

# The APK ships as a release asset (gh release create), never as a tracked file —
# committing each build would grow git history by ~5 MB permanently.
*.apk

# Junk
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
